# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the sanitizer build (EIO_SANITIZE=ON).
#
# ONNX Runtime allocates a few small global objects (its CPU-feature detection and
# static initialisers) and never frees them. Loading libonnxruntime alone with
# dlopen/dlclose, without any project code, reproduces the same report. Leaks in this
# project's own code are not suppressed and still fail the tests.
leak:libonnxruntime
